package corpus

// The knowledge base of "Orbit", a fictional managed-database platform, and the
// tickets its customers write. Articles use the vocabulary a documentation team
// uses; archetype phrasings use the vocabulary a customer at 2 a.m. uses. Where a
// phrasing happens to share a word with its article, that is fine — real tickets
// sometimes do — but most of them deliberately do not.

// Articles is the knowledge base.
